{"id":"torrey:midianites","source":"torrey","name":"Midianites","slug":"midianites","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descended form Midian, son of Abraham by Keturah — Ge 25:1,2; 1Ch 1:32.","refs":[["Gen",25,1,25,1],["Gen",25,2,25,2],["1Chr",1,32,1,32]]},{"text":"Dwelt east of Jordan, beside Moab — Nu 22:1,4.","refs":[["Num",22,1,22,1],["Num",22,4,22,4]]},{"text":"Dwelt near Horeb. — Ex 2:15; 3:1.","refs":[["Exod",2,15,2,15],["Exod",3,1,3,1]]},{"text":"Retained the knowledge and worship of Jehovah. — Ex 2:16; 18:9-12.","refs":[["Exod",2,16,2,16],["Exod",18,9,18,12]]},{"text":"Governed by kings — Nu 31:8; Jdj 8:5.","refs":[["Num",31,8,31,8],["Judg",8,5,8,5]]},{"text":"Dwelt in tents — Hab 3:7.","refs":[["Hab",3,7,3,7]]},{"text":"Engaged in commerce — Ge 37:28,36.","refs":[["Gen",37,28,37,28],["Gen",37,36,37,36]]},{"text":"Conquered by Hadad — Ge 36:25; 1Ch 1:46.","refs":[["Gen",36,25,36,25],["1Chr",1,46,1,46]]},{"text":"Excited by Moab against Israel — Nu 22:4.","refs":[["Num",22,4,22,4]]},{"text":"Terrified at approach of Israel — Hab 3:3-7.","refs":[["Hab",3,3,3,7]]},{"text":"Sent for Balaam to curse Israel. — Nu 22:5-7.","refs":[["Num",22,5,22,7]]},{"text":"Seduced Israel to idolatry. — Nu 25:1-6.","refs":[["Num",25,1,25,6]]},{"text":"Punished for seducing Israel. — Nu 25:16-18; 31:1-12.","refs":[["Num",25,16,25,18],["Num",31,1,31,12]]},{"text":"Allowed to oppress Israel — Jdj 6:1-6.","refs":[["Judg",6,1,6,6]]},{"text":"Gideon raised up against — Jdj 6:11-14.","refs":[["Judg",6,11,6,14]]},{"text":"With Amalek, &c opposed Gideon — Jdj 6:33.","refs":[["Judg",6,33,6,33]]},{"text":"Miraculously defeated and destroyed by Gideon — Jdj 7:16-22; 8:10,11.","refs":[["Judg",7,16,7,22],["Judg",8,10,8,10],["Judg",8,11,8,11]]},{"text":"Princes of, slain — Jdj 7:24,25; 8:12,21.","refs":[["Judg",7,24,7,24],["Judg",7,25,7,25],["Judg",8,12,8,12],["Judg",8,21,8,21]]},{"text":"Completeness of their destruction, alluded to — Ps 83:9-11; Isa 9:4; 10:26.","refs":[["Ps",83,9,83,11],["Isa",9,4,9,4],["Isa",10,26,10,26]]},{"text":"Shall minister to future glory of the church — Isa 60:6.","refs":[["Isa",60,6,60,6]]}],"refCount":36}
